WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.480
Nothing is more hateful

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:09.180
than failing to protect the one you love.

00:00:09.180 --> 00:00:18.380
There's no justice in this world unless we
make it

00:00:18.380 --> 00:00:20.289
Avenge Them

00:00:20.289 --> 00:00:28.449
I believe men of talent have a part to play
in the war to come.

00:00:28.449 --> 00:00:34.469
I will never sit on the Iron Throne.

00:00:34.469 --> 00:00:37.000
You could help another climb those steps and
take that seat.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:43.460
I'm not going to stop the wheel,

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:50.980
I'm going to break the wheel.

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:55.511
That little monster is out there somewhere
drawing breath.

00:00:55.511 --> 00:01:01.149
I don't think I'm ready for what I deserve.

00:01:01.149 --> 00:01:08.540
They'll never even find what's left of you.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.100
Strip away the gold

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:16.400
Knock down the statues

00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:21.160
and this is what remains...

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:28.080
The seven kingdoms needs a ruler loved by
millions, with a powerful army and the right

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:29.480
family name.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.840
Good luck finding him.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:36.070
Who said anything about "him"?

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:58.700
Hey everybody, thanks for all the awesome
comments on my Trailer video from last night.

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:08.970
Those are always fun to make after 10 cups
of coffee waiting for footage 

00:02:08.970 --> 00:02:18.239
to post and then sifting through all the crappy
cell phone versions.

00:02:18.239 --> 00:02:20.132
There’s some big news I’ll start with.

00:02:20.132 --> 00:02:23.959
George RR Martin confirmed no Winds of Winter
this year.

00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:25.200
I’m not super surprised.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:33.069
But they are releasing all three of the Dunk
and Egg short stories in a collected edition.

00:02:33.069 --> 00:02:36.960
"The Hedge Knight," "The Sworn Sword" and
"The Mystery Knight."

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.290
There’s no official release date for that
book.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.299
But I’ll totally give a couple copies away
when it gets here.

00:02:40.299 --> 00:02:43.400
Right now the books are out of print so this
is really cool.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:49.670
If you haven’t read any of the short stories,
they’re prequels set a long time before

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:54.629
the events going on in the books right now.

00:02:54.629 --> 00:03:01.430
Maisie Williams also did a Reddit AMA, but
it was for the bullying movie she just released.

00:03:01.430 --> 00:03:03.000
She didn’t talk about any Game of Thrones
Spoilers.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:04.650
On to Season 5 Trailer fun stuff -

00:03:04.650 --> 00:03:12.310
There were a couple of big questions everyone
had that I can answer right away.

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.739
Careful for spoilers through season 4 on the
show.

00:03:14.739 --> 00:03:17.099
Yes, this woman is young cersei.

00:03:17.099 --> 00:03:21.069
The reason she pricks her finger and bleeds
is because Maggy the frog has to taste her

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:23.090
blood to read her future.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:29.420
Because they included a flashback scene in
the trailer.

00:03:29.420 --> 00:03:32.640
This scene here is also probably Cersei and
her friend Melara.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:36.720
So maybe they’ll show the infamous Melara
scene.

00:03:36.720 --> 00:03:40.700
The books never made that explicit but I always
felt her death was implied.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:44.720
Some of these scenes up north of the wall
might also be at Hardholme.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:50.029
Eastwatch by the Sea is one of the other possible
locations.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:52.930
It does look like there’s an assault on
Hardholme at some point.

00:03:52.930 --> 00:03:57.739
It’s a run down wildling town up here on
the coast beyond the haunted forest.

00:03:57.739 --> 00:04:02.959
This character here might be the Lord of Bones
without his mask on.

00:04:02.959 --> 00:04:05.180
Probably from this same area near the shoreline.

00:04:05.180 --> 00:04:10.359
This box that opens for Cersei is most definitely
from the Martells.

00:04:10.359 --> 00:04:13.659
Now that we have a nice sharp version we can
see the snake head.

00:04:13.659 --> 00:04:15.299
This pendant is probably Myrcellas.

00:04:15.299 --> 00:04:18.780
This is probably what incites Jaime to go
to Dorne with Bronn.

00:04:18.780 --> 00:04:20.920
To make sure she’s okay.

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.480
As for Martells and Dorne.

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:26.700
It looks like they’re giving the Arianne
Martell part in the books to Ellaria Sand.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:30.360
Yes it’s a change from the books, but given
what happened to Oberyn it’s not a huge

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.400
leap to think she would flip her shit and
go on the warpath.

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:33.400
She doesn’t command any troops.

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:34.400
She’s not part of the royal family, so she
needs to convince the noble born sand snakes

00:04:34.400 --> 00:04:35.400
and Prince Doran to do something.

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:36.890
That gets into Dornish Master plan.

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:40.330
Yes, I do think we will see a version of that
explained.

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:42.940
Prince Doran is a very smart person.

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:47.450
Of course the tv show version of him will
have a plan for the Lannisters.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:53.210
I still cant’ tell but I think we will see
lemon trees in Sunspear.

00:04:53.210 --> 00:04:59.940
Margeary and Tommen’s wedding, I’m sure
Cersei will enjoy that.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.350
This looks like Tyrion and Varys in Meereen

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:09.940
It looks like Maester Aemon is on that funeral
pyre

00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:13.200
This doesn’t look like one of the sand snakes,
but I still think it’s in Dorne.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:17.670
I think they’ll give some of the more salacious
Arys Oakheart scenes to Jaime and Bronn.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.940
These soldiers could also be the Brazen Beasts.

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.900
They’re a group of fighters formed by Daenerys.

00:05:23.900 --> 00:05:26.160
This Dragon is actually Rhaegal.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:29.600
Now that we have an HD version we can see
the green color.

00:05:29.600 --> 00:05:33.000
Look how big he is.

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:36.790
He’s bigger than Drogon was last year.

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.790
So imagine what that means for Drogon.

00:05:37.790 --> 00:05:42.190
And then this, the statue falling down the
pyramid might be a replacement for what Quentyn

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:44.990
Martell does at the end of Dance with Dragons.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:49.342
Please use spoiler tags, because that is kind
of a big one.

